@RagServer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

### Ingest files from the configured KnowledgeBasePath
# Note: ingestion skips dot-prefixed folders recursively and excludes .yaml/.yml files.
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ingest
Accept: application/json

###

### Ask a question using retrieved context + Ollama generation
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "What are the main responsibilities of this API?",
  "model": "qwen2.5-coder:14b",
  "useKnowledgeBase": true
}

###

### Ask directly (no knowledge base retrieval)
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "Explain vector embeddings in simple terms.",
  "model": "qwen2.5-coder:14b",
  "useKnowledgeBase": false
}

###

### Stream answer tokens + final citations (SSE)
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ask/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "query": "tell me about .NET 10",
  "model": "qwen2.5-coder:14b",
  "useKnowledgeBase": true,
  "history": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "do you know .NET 10?" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, I do." }
  ]
}

###

### Get configured chat models and default model
GET {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/models
Accept: application/json

###

### Stream ingest progress events (SSE)
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ingest/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

###

### Start ingest operation
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ingest/start
Accept: application/json

###

@operationId = replace-with-operation-id
### Stream ingest by operation id
GET {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ingest/{{operationId}}/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

###

### Cancel ingest by operation id
POST {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/ingest/{{operationId}}/cancel
Accept: application/json

###

### Clear all indexed RAG data
DELETE {{RagServer.Api_HostAddress}}/data
Accept: application/json

###
